WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,920
How to sell this meat

2
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:03,560
Eight yuan a pound of fat is eight yuan.

3
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,320
Can you give me a hundred pounds?

4
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:11,330
There is also rice for sale here

5
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:13,570
What is sold here is not in bulk.

6
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:14,850
But it comes in packages

7
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:16,050
The cheapest rice is 100 kilograms

8
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:20,360
It’s only 190 yuan. I want ten bags of rice, okay?

9
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:23,440
I only have a few dozen dollars left with me. Let's go back first.

10
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:34,250
Come back next time to make money. General, you are back. I have tried. Only you can do it. I can’t do it. Oh my god.

11
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:37,010
This is pork, so much fat, we have meat to eat

12
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:37,970
Come and get these things away

13
00:00:37,970 --> 00:00:42,690
Let us eat in different ways. I know you can rest assured that there will be arrangements over there. Is there any news?

14
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:44,930
After I sent them to eat, I went out again to find out that they had indeed left.

15
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:46,810
For the sake of us not being wiped out in three years

16
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:47,930
Now we are at the end of our rope

17
00:00:47,930 --> 00:00:48,850
But they withdrew

18
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:52,020
I don't think there's anything right about this matter, General.

19
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,660
Don’t worry about how you dress like this

20
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:56,420
I understand what they wear on the floating ground in winter, but the soldiers on their side

21
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:59,980
It has indeed been withdrawn. I am wondering if there is some internal problem with them.
